{"id": "31622", "title": "娇红记", "author": "孟称舜", "category": "文学名著", "count": 51, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/31/31622.htm", "intro": "《娇红记》上、下二卷，是现存中国宋以后中篇文言小说中最早的一部。现多以《娇红记杂剧》形式出现，在《娇红记杂剧序》中有“元清江宋梅洞尝著《娇红记》一编，事俱而文深。”一句，推知书作者为宋梅洞。宋梅洞，名远，今江西樟树人。\r\n　　《娇红记》单刻本，今所见，有明建安书林郑云竹刊本，书名作《申琦建拥炉娇红记》，题“元邵庵虎伯生编缉，闽武夷彭海东评释”。明代小说总集，多收录此篇，如：《艳异编》、《国色天香》、《绣谷春客》、《情史类略》、《风流十使》、《燕居笔记》等。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31622", "chapters": [{"title": "第 一 出", "file": "2043847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 二 出", "file": "2043806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 三 出", "file": "2043807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 四 出", "file": "2043808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 五 出", "file": "2043809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 六 出", "file": "2043810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 七 出", "file": "2043848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 八 出", "file": "2043811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 九 出", "file": "2043812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十 出", "file": "2043813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一出", "file": "2043814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二出", "file": "2043815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三出", "file": "2043849.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四出", "file": "2043816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五出", "file": "2043817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六出", "file": "2043818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七出", "file": "2043819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八出", "file": "2043820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九出", "file": "2043850.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十出", "file": "2043821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿一出", "file": "2043822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿二出", "file": "2043823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿三出", "file": "2043824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第廿四出", "file": "2043825.html", "available": false}, {"title"